{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"58143a3b43d676f3d7d724794e12c337ba8033fc66d2671b314446a975a12bf4","ja":"真実は闇の中？","zh":"真相仍隐藏在黑暗中？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1ca40a109bfd94454a77c7e418680f045e4e6657a773cd2f91f6bb865a097e81","ja":"なんで急に停電に！？　も、もしかして、\n私がお札を落としちゃったから！？","zh":"怎么突然停电了！？难、难道是因为\n我把符咒弄掉了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0a99a8b366ac5337ca7ab233a633e3aefcf0ff54300057a4e6190ab05a05e03d","ja":"そ、それで、悪いオバケが怒って……。","zh":"然、然后，坏幽灵就生气了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b1267b8c9e0a2ecdb16f95bfbcfbdd0c3283ed90e3e0ea2a0d589a72b00d66e1","ja":"や、矢吹さん！\n落ち着いてくださ……あっ。","zh":"矢、矢吹同学！\n请冷静一……啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"867efd3c05a2ec4ba36fd9b5821655dc2bec8fed2f4b0fe74fa7693d34dd5a11","ja":"よかった～。オバケのしわざだったら、\nお菓子をあげなきゃって思ったよぉ。","zh":"太好了～。要是幽灵搞的鬼，\n我还以为必须给它点心呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"5ff8f90ce8eaab30348d487de95a3043521f7012887d8a90b4f7f15cbb626a51","ja":"そ、そうだね……って、あれっ！？\nす、スタンドが……倒れてる！？","zh":"是、是啊……等等，咦！？\n支、支架……倒了！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"3ebb2511c16342c0ef4150215766a9574362e8c1f929c89469ff50e78d821960","ja":"い、今の騒ぎでたまたま倒れただけのはずです！\nそんな……ハロウィンの悪霊なんて、いるわけ……。","zh":"刚、刚才只是因为混乱碰巧倒下来的而已！\n怎么会……万圣节的恶灵什么的，怎么可能存在……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"96b77975671a6fae1d5c3ba5b6ce9a5733325104733bcf0980da9295576ecb03","ja":"トントン……トントン……","zh":"咚咚……咚咚……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"e18ac2aa4131851521d62e531a91f81458c2b4c01dc789f745f8dac5e02bd42a","ja":"きゃ～～～～っ！？","zh":"呀～～～～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"5c8723fad5fd9a5acca09f9a90375aff87e355299584074c9dced9ecf0e2f3e4","ja":"ひっ……！","zh":"咿……！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"fa734046ccfc273a41794082d40cdaedd6f9d8428f55b3531e5ff49109ad2f64","ja":"ひゃっ……！","zh":"呀……！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"a60a7394c83888abd2968a951539115487f2fb5b3ecaa71fd26ea26ec903a559","ja":"「すみません！　ブレーカーが落ちてしまって……。\nあ、スタンドここに紛れてましたか。回収しますね！」","zh":"「不好意思！跳闸了……。\n啊，支架混在这边了吗。我这就收走哦！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"2f1db7ce1e95ad631f0854e6442ce26b3a65bc184ae71b1461af8f1fd75ff575","ja":"あっ、このスタンドは、\nスタッフさんがご用意された小道具だったのですね。","zh":"啊，这个看台是\n工作人员准备的道具呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"b3533ee310f2517edbd027472a53b2496fd8160b851788446c7fd5e0958927b7","ja":"……なーんだ！　じゃあ、お札も\n小道具ってことですよね？　よかった～。","zh":"……什么嘛！那也就是说，钞票也\n只是道具吧？太好了～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"dfde26bca82c53d5fa98359d490408470bafe72afdf136fc091d4c21f687a183","ja":"「はい？　お札って、なんのことでしょう？\nあ、すみません。次のステージがあるので後で！」","zh":"「诶？您说的纸币，是指什么呀？\n啊，不好意思。接下来还有舞台演出，待会儿再说吧！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"c14f5ca46d51f0503863c003d03c2a618230daefd5639a1d9198ac5a376ec407","ja":"……え？　だって、スタンドの裏からお札が……\nそうだ、まだ持って……あれっ！？　ない！？","zh":"……诶？可是，看台后面明明有符纸……\n对了，我还拿着……咦！？不见了！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"b1941d8a18be3af2dfb339d2447f48df3a5c2a73c4622097c78a55e537b2418f","ja":"や、やっぱり、なにかいるんだろか？","zh":"难、难道说，真的有什么东西在吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"a0727ee03319b4e368f3a391a69cae053d256b58736fad49f865f179ff075111","ja":"夜公演があるから、\nまだこの部屋にいないといけないのに……。","zh":"因为还有晚场公演，\n明明还必须待在这个房间里的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"c50a30cf28661e9752b753d33e146ee6995f056f2207d11ee65fb373adc36019","ja":"そんな、霊がいる控え室なんて……き、気のせいです！\nこ、こんなときこそ、何か明るい話題でも……。","zh":"怎么可能会有幽灵出没的休息室……一、一定是心理作用！\n越、越是这种时候，就越该聊点欢快的话题……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1665.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"ac86361a7b3a566661a4d89df442b4a20014d94650270dedabc959c4e26c84d7","ja":"は、はい。えーっと……む、無理です～！\n怖すぎて、なんにも思いつきませ～ん！","zh":"是、是的。那个……不、不行的啦～！\n太害怕了，完全想不出来～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
